---
description: "Logging, error tracking, Web Vitals budgets. Apply for observability and perf-sensitive UI."
globs:
  - "**/instrumentation*.*"
  - "**/sentry*.*"
  - "**/*logger*.*"
  - "**/*.{tsx,jsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Observability & Budgets

- Log levels: error/warn/info/debug; structured logs; correlate request IDs; never log secrets/PII.
- Capture unhandled errors/5xx/fatals when configured; never empty-catch to “finish”.
- Web Vitals Good (p75): LCP ≤ 2.5s, INP ≤ 200ms, CLS ≤ 0.1 (stricter in `project-context`).
- Alert on user impact, not vanity CPU alone.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/devops/observability.md`
